<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.29 points off FTSE, June 30.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.29 points off FTSE, June 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stock will trade ex-dividend on June 30 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.29 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>						DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>						(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>	     COMPANY		    Net   Gross     Gross</p>
<p>	     * Granada Group	 4.66   5.825     0.291</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5113</p>
</text>
